    <statement><p>Simplify the expression 
<me>\frac{\frac{2}{a+h}-\frac{2}{a}}{h}</me> 
and give your answer in the form of
<me>\frac{A}{B}.</me></p>
<p>Your answer for <m>A</m> is : <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>Your answer for <m>B</m> is : <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-2</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(a+h\right)a</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
